Title: Judge's Ask Me X word Puzzle No. 3
Author: Dorothy Van Heusen
Date: 1927-05-14
Byline: Submitted by Dorothy Van Heusen, New York City. Judge pays $10 for each puzzle printed.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-05-14_92/page/n31/mode/1up
Number: 3
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-05-21_92/page/n32/mode/1up


PISTOL#CHECKS
INC#H#C#A#HIT
SNAP#IOU#GATE
T#ROADSTERS#R
OK#O#ETA#A#ON
N#FLEA#HIDE#S
#FARO###RULE#
E#TONG#DEAF#P
SH#O#RIO#T#HE
K#EMBATTLED#P
INNS#BEE#SOAP
MAD#M#M#P#OLE
OYSTER#FARMER


A1. What is a Chicago voting machine? ~ PISTOL
A5. What sort of appeal have butter and egg men? ~ CHECKS
A10. What is an abbreviation for "incorporated?" ~ INC
A12. What do ball players do when they go batty? ~ HIT
A13. What is a soft job? ~ SNAP
A15. What are letters of credit? ~ IOU
A17. What do prize fighters fight for? ~ GATE
A18. Name something that has put many a good girl on her feet. (Plural). ~ ROADSTERS
A19. How is Gertrude Lawrence's new show? ~ OK
A20. Name a Greek letter. ~ ETA
A21. Name a preposition of place. ~ ON
A22. Name something that is always going to the dogs. ~ FLEA
A24. What is the best thing to do when the Federal Agents come? ~ HIDE
A27. Name a game of chance. ~ FARO
A28. What is used by carpenters as a rule? ~ RULE
A30. What kind of war do Chinese icemen have? ~ TONG
A32. What sort of people would give a thousand dollars to hear a German opera? ~ DEAF
A34. What letters suggest a sound which means "be quiet"? ~ SH
A35. What is the home of Spanish mackerel? ~ RIO
A37. Name a masculine pronoun. ~ HE
A38. What are both sides of the Chinese situation? ~ EMBATTLED
A40. What are roadside restaurants? ~ INNS
A42. What is a hum bug? ~ BEE
A43. What is good for a clean-up? (Lux against this.) ~ SOAP
A45. What are crazy people? ~ MAD
A48. Name an English exclamation. ~ OLE
A49. What is as silent as a clam? ~ OYSTER
A50. What sort of fellow knows his onions? ~ FARMER

D1. What has its ups and downs in motoring? ~ PISTON
D2. Name the lair of highway robbers. ~ INN
D3. What is the sign of a duel personality? ~ SCAR
D4. Name an exclamation. ~ OH
D6. What do villains say? ~ HA
D7. What is the first name of a brother of William Howard Taft (abbr.)? ~ CHAS
D8. What is a soldier's carry-all? ~ KIT
D9. What are the rear ends of South American steamers in a heavy fog.? ~ STERNS
D11. What makes the high cost of living? ~ COST
D14. Where does Naive Nancy think people go swimming? ~ POOLROOMS
D15. What should be treated kindly and then executed? ~ IDEA
D16. What is a famous state of matrimony? ~ UTAH
D17. What does a blonde co-ed do before she finishes college? ~ GRADUATES
D22. What are fat women when they ride horseback? ~ FAT
D23. What is a space of time.? ~ EON
D25. What makes crossword fans terribly terribly angry? ~ IRE
D26. Name a little sprite. ~ ELF
D29. Name one of God's Frozen People. ~ ESKIMO
D31. What kind of a bag do politicians hold? ~ GRAB
D32. What do people do when they have a yen? ~ DOTE
D33. What is hot stuff all the year 'round? ~ PEPPER
D36. What is a newspaper paragraph called? ~ ITEM
D38. What do butchers have trouble making meet.? ~ ENDS
D39. What will the last crack be? ~ DOOM
D41. What is an old negative? ~ NAY
D44. What was the cargo of most old-fashioned schooners? ~ ALE
D46. Name a masculine personal pronoun. ~ ME
D47. What is the kin you love to touch? ~ PA


